# Keep the build context small while retaining every input used by the
# repository release Dockerfiles and the root ModelScope wrapper.
#
# Note: a directory excluded by `**` cannot have its contents re-included
# unless the directory itself is whitelisted first, so each path appears twice
# (once for the directory, once for its contents).
**
!Dockerfile
!build/
!build/docker/
!build/docker/**
!build/docker-alpine/
!build/docker-alpine/**
!scripts/
!scripts/dockerfiles/
!scripts/dockerfiles/**
!scripts/ms-proxy/
!scripts/ms-proxy/**
